+/*
+ * 0353: the modem's file service, as linux-msm/rmtfs (service 14, version 1, instance 0; qmi_rmtfs.qmi) and Android's
+ * rmt_storage. READ ONLY for the phone: a partition is copied to RAM when opened (modemst1, modemst2, fsc, fsg), the
